  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\n**Decoding signs:**\n\n \n \n\n **Letter**\n A\n B\n C\n D\n \n \n\n **Stands For**\n ÷\n ×\n +\n –\n \n \n\n**Required resultant:** 100\n\nSo, checking each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) 15 C 9 D 810 A 9 B 55 ⇒ 15 + 9 - 810 ÷ 9 × 55\n\n⇒ 15 + 9 - __**810 **____**÷**____** 9**__ × 55\n\n⇒ 15 + 9 - __**90**____** × 55**__\n\n⇒ __**15 + 9**__ - 4950\n\n⇒ __**24 - 4950**__\n\n⇒ -4926\n\nOption 2) 15 A 9 D 810 B 9 C 55 ⇒ 15 ÷ 9 - 810 × 9 + 55\n\n⇒ __**15 ÷**____** 9**__ - 810 × 9 + 55\n\n⇒ 1.67 - __**810 **____**×**____** 9**__ + 55\n\n⇒ __**1.67**____** + 55**__ - 7290\n\n⇒ __56.67 ____**- 7290**__\n\n⇒ -7233.33\n\nOption 3) 15 B 9 D 810 A 9 C 55 ⇒ 15 × 9 - 810 ÷ 9 + 55\n\n⇒ 15 × 9 - __**810 **____**÷**____** 9**__ + 55\n\n⇒ __**15 ×**____** 9**__ - 90 + 55\n\n⇒ __**135 **____**+ 55**__ - 90\n\n⇒ __**190 - 90**__\n\n⇒ 100\n\nOption 4) 15 D 9 B 810 A 9 C 55 ⇒ 15 - 9 × 810 ÷ 9 + 55\n\n⇒ 15 - 9 × __**810 **____**÷**____** 9**__ + 55\n\n⇒ 15 - __**9 **____**× 90**__ + 55\n\n⇒ __**15 + 55**__ - 810\n\n⇒ __70** - **__**__810__**\n\n⇒ -740\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
